§ 78_GAME_FIRST_PIVOT_2026-05-18 · supersede deferral framing · game = revenue · Apocrypha PAUSED
  ← author : Tech-Lead-Claude-Opus-4.7-1M · 2026-05-18 (intra-day amendment)
  ← supersedes : DEFERRAL-FRAMING sections of specs/55 + 59 + 75 + 76 + 77
