  ← scope : cross-cutting · strategic-direction amendment
  ← parent-template : specs/_TEMPLATE.csl
  ← discipline : authored under specs/64_SPEC_FIRST_DISCIPLINE.csl
  ← canonical-directive : Apocky 2026-05-18 — "Pivot towards the game aspects of the language for now, we're
                                                  putting Apocrypha on hold. The game *IS* the revenue first path
                                                  so do not try to defer anything. Begin work towards this."

§I THESIS
  ⟦
    The earlier-2026-05 strategic posture (spec/55 NORMAL_ENGINE_PIVOT 2026-05-03 + spec/59 GROK_VELOCITY_RESPONSE
    revenue-first-via-harness/apocky.com/alpha-keys + spec/75-77 multi-quarter-deferral framing) is amended in-place
    by Apocky 2026-05-18 verbatim directive. Three concrete amendments :

    (1) GAME = REVENUE · ¬ harness · ¬ apocky.com paid tiers · ¬ consulting · ¬ alpha-key-tiered-access-only.
        The game itself (LoA · already-packaged at dist/LoA-v0.1.0-alpha-windows-x64/) is the revenue vehicle.
        Other revenue vehicles from spec/59 (harness + apocky.com tiers + consulting) are NOT-CANCELLED but
        are SECONDARY to making-the-game-better-and-more-saleable.

    (2) APOCRYPHA = ON HOLD · the prior [[feedback_apocrypha_vs_game_separation]] memory (D043 2026-05-17
        "Track-A Apocrypha completes BEFORE Track-B game-engine begins") is REVERSED. CSSLv3 game-engine work
        is the active track ; Apocrypha is paused. The mutually-exclusive-runtime + CSSL-language-only-bridge
        discipline from D043 is PRESERVED in-full (no runtime-sharing · no CfC-bus-cross-projects · no
        shared HRR · no Python↔Rust IPC).

    (3) NO DEFERRAL · do not phrase work as "post-revenue / multi-quarter / P4-eventually / DEFERRED indefinitely /
        stretch goal." Treat every roadmap item as actively-pursued unless Apocky explicitly approves a specific
        deferral. Sequencing-by-dependency is permitted (that's not deferral · that's ordering) ; sequencing-by-
        revenue-tier is NOT permitted post this directive.

    The substantive content of specs/55 + 59 + 75 + 76 + 77 is preserved as historical record + technical reference.
    The TIMING-FRAMING of those specs is SUPERSEDED by this amendment. Future spec-authoring + roadmap-planning
    + work-execution operates under this amendment's posture.
  ⟧

